 sound/soc/codecs/lpass-tx-macro.c | 124 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 sound/soc/codecs/lpass-va-macro.c |  75 ++++++++++++++---------
 3 files changed, 142 insertions(+), 59 deletions(-)

